releases/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# v2.9 component library (Route B): the upstream clones and the svg bodies are
# rebuildable artifacts. Only index.json / attribution.md / README.md are tracked.
library/components/*/repo/
library/components/*/svg/
library/components/*/previews/

# examples/build_demo.py output when run from the repo root
demo-project/

# web/research-map: dependencies, the Vite build and video renders are rebuildable.
# The built page that ships is scripts/research_map_app.html.
web/research-map/node_modules/
web/research-map/dist/
web/research-map/out/
# Smiley Sans is fetched by hand (see web/research-map/README.md)
web/research-map/video/public/fonts/*
!web/research-map/video/public/fonts/.gitkeep
